type: software
title: "civic-tech-crawler"
abstract: "A Python CLI tool that crawls GitHub repositories to collect repository-health, contributor, and temporal metrics for civic technology research. Implements CHAOSS metrics, bot detection, social network analysis of pull-request review collaboration, and DORA software delivery indicators."
